GATE="gradle-wrapper"
EXPECT_EXIT="2"
DESCRIPTION="A gate that dies on an unhandled command must exit 2 and still write a report. Before the ERR trap existed this case exited 1 with no report at all -- a crashed scanner was indistinguishable from a scanner that found something, which is precisely the confusion the 1/2 split exists to prevent, happening inside the file that defines the split. Nothing caught it because set -e aborted the process before the reporting line was reached."
